# NexusBot — Complete Codebase Walkthrough

> A full breakdown of every file, API call, database query, button, and user action in the app.

---

## 🗂️ Project Structure

```
Chatbot app UI design/
├── backend/index.ts          ← Express.js AI backend server
├── database/schemas/         ← Supabase SQL schema files
├── frontend/src/
│   ├── main.tsx              ← React entry point
│   ├── lib/supabase.ts       ← Supabase client singleton
│   └── app/
│       ├── App.tsx           ← Router config (all routes)
│       └── components/
│           ├── auth/         AuthPage.tsx
│           ├── layout/       Layout.tsx (sidebar + topbar shell)
│           ├── chat/         ChatbotSelectionPage, ChatInterface, ChatbotManagePage, EmbeddedChatPage
│           ├── faq/          FAQManager, FAQEditor
│           ├── workflow/     WorkflowInterface, WorkflowEditor
│           ├── analytics/    AnalyticsPage
│           ├── profile/      ProfilePage
│           ├── settings/     SettingsPage
│           └── ui/           48 shadcn/radix UI primitives
```

---

## 🛠️ Tech Stack

| Layer | Technology |
|---|---|
| Frontend | React 18 + TypeScript + Vite |
| Routing | React Router v7 |
| Styling | Tailwind CSS |
| Database & Auth | Supabase (PostgreSQL + Auth) |
| AI Backend | Express.js + Groq SDK (`llama-3.3-70b-versatile`) |
| Animation | Framer Motion (`motion/react`) |

---

## 🗃️ Database Schema (`database/schemas/`)

### Tables

| Table | Key Columns | Purpose |
|---|---|---|
| `profiles` | `id` (= auth.users), `full_name`, `email`, `avatar_url` | Extends Supabase auth with user info |
| `chatbots` | `id`, `user_id`, `name`, `description` | Each user can have multiple chatbots |
| `chatbot_settings` | `chatbot_id`, `default_greeting`, `persona`, `language`, `avatar_url` | Per-chatbot configuration |
| `chatbot_knowledge_sources` | `chatbot_id`, `source_type` (url/text), `content`, `status` | Custom knowledge per chatbot |
| `conversations` | `id`, `user_id`, `chatbot_id`, `title`, `preview`, `starred` | Chat sessions |
| `messages` | `id`, `conversation_id`, `role` (user/assistant), `content`, `timestamp` | Individual messages |
| `workflows` | `id`, `chatbot_id`, `name`, `status`, `nodes` (JSONB), `steps` (JSONB) | Chat automation flows |
| `faqs` | `id`, `chatbot_id`, `question`, `answer`, `status`, `tags`, `helpful`, `not_helpful`, `views` | Knowledge base Q&A |

**Row Level Security**: All tables have RLS enabled. Users can only access their own data. A Postgres trigger `on_auth_user_created` automatically creates a `profiles` row on signup.

---

## ⚙️ Backend Server (`backend/index.ts`)

An **Express.js** server with 2 endpoints:

### `GET /health`
- No rate limiting
- Returns server status and active user count
- Used to verify the backend is running

### `POST /api/chat` *(rate-limited)*
**Rate Limit**: 50 messages/user/day (tracked by IP + user agent in memory)

**Request body:**
```json
{
  "message": "user's message",
  "chatbotContext": { "name": "Bot Name", "description": "..." },
  "conversationHistory": [ ...last 5 messages ],
  "userName": "John"
}
```

**What it does:**
1. Checks rate limit (returns 429 if exceeded)
2. Builds a system prompt using the chatbot's name, description, and user's first name
3. Includes last 5 messages as context
4. Calls **Groq API** (`llama-3.3-70b-versatile`, temp=0.7, max_tokens=1024)
5. Returns `{ response, model, tokensUsed }`

---

## 🔌 Supabase Client (`frontend/src/lib/supabase.ts`)

```ts
export const supabase = createClient(VITE_SUPABASE_URL, VITE_SUPABASE_ANON_KEY);
```
Singleton used everywhere in the frontend. Credentials come from `.env`.

---

## 🛣️ Routing (`App.tsx`)

| Path | Component | Description |
|---|---|---|
| `/` | Redirect → `/auth` | Root always redirects to login |
| `/auth` | `AuthPage` | Login/signup page |
| `/embed/:chatbotId` | `EmbeddedChatPage` | Public embeddable chat widget |
| `/app` | `ChatbotSelectionPage` | Choose which chatbot to use |
| `/app/chat/:chatbotId` | `ChatInterface` | Main chat UI |
| `/app/chat/:chatbotId/manage` | `ChatbotManagePage` | Edit chatbot name |
| `/app/workflows` | `WorkflowInterface` | List all workflows |
| `/app/workflows/:id` | `WorkflowEditor` | Create/edit workflow |
| `/app/faq` | `FAQManager` | List/manage FAQs |
| `/app/faq/:id` | `FAQEditor` | Create/edit an FAQ |
| `/app/analytics` | `AnalyticsPage` | Platform metrics |
| `/app/profile` | `ProfilePage` | Update user info/password |
| `/app/settings` | `SettingsPage` | Dark mode toggle, chatbot links |

