### `AuthPage.tsx` — Login & Signup

**State**: `mode` (login/signup), `form` (name, email, password), `loading`, `showPassword`

#### Supabase API Calls
| Action | Call |
|---|---|
| Login | `supabase.auth.signInWithPassword({ email, password })` |
| Sign Up | `supabase.auth.signUp({ email, password, data: { full_name } })` |

Both have a **10-second timeout** using `Promise.race`. On success → navigate to `/app`.

#### Buttons & Actions
| Button | Action |
|---|---|
| **Sign In / Sign Up tab toggle** | Switches `mode` between `"login"` and `"signup"` |
| 👁 **Eye icon** (password input) | Toggles `showPassword` to show/hide password text |
| **Forgot password?** | Currently a no-op button (no handler implemented) |
| **Sign In / Create Account** (submit) | Calls `handleSubmit()` → Supabase auth |
| **Google / GitHub** buttons | Both just navigate to `/app` (OAuth not actually wired) |

