Wraps all `/app/**` pages via `<Outlet />`.

#### Supabase API Calls
| Trigger | Call |
|---|---|
| On mount | `supabase.auth.getSession()` — checks if user is logged in, redirects to `/auth` if not |
| Auth state change | `supabase.auth.onAuthStateChange(...)` — listens for session changes (real-time) |
| Logout button | `supabase.auth.signOut()` → navigate to `/auth` |

#### Sidebar Nav Links
| Link | Path | Icon |
|---|---|---|
| Chat | `/app/chat/:chatbotId` (or `/app`) | MessageSquare |
| Workflows | `/app/workflows` | GitBranch |
| FAQ Manager | `/app/faq` | HelpCircle |
| Analysis | `/app/analytics` | BarChart2 |
| Settings | `/app/settings` | Settings |

#### Buttons & Actions (Top Bar)
| Button | Action |
|---|---|
| **Sidebar collapse toggle** (chevron) | Collapses sidebar from 240px → 64px |
| **NexusBot logo** | Navigates to `/app` |
| 🔔 **Bell icon** | UI only, no action |
| ☀️/🌙 **Theme toggle** | Calls `handleDarkModeToggle()` → adds/removes `dark` class on `<html>`, saves to `localStorage` |
| **User avatar (top bar)** | Opens dropdown menu |
| **Profile** (dropdown) | Navigate to `/app/profile` |
| **Settings** (dropdown) | Navigate to `/app/settings` |
| **Logout** (dropdown) | `supabase.auth.signOut()` → navigate to `/auth` |
| **LogOut icon** (sidebar footer) | Same: `supabase.auth.signOut()` |

