### `ChatbotSelectionPage.tsx` — Choose a Chatbot

#### Supabase Queries
| When | Query |
|---|---|
| On mount | `supabase.auth.getUser()` |
| On mount | `SELECT * FROM chatbots ORDER BY created_at ASC` |
| If no bots exist | `INSERT INTO chatbots (user_id, name, description)` — creates "My Chatbot" automatically |
| Create button | `INSERT INTO chatbots (user_id, name)` |

#### Buttons & Actions
| Button | Action |
|---|---|
| **Create Chatbot** (top right) | Opens create modal with `setShowCreateModal(true)` |
| **Chatbot card** (click) | Saves `activeChatbotId` to `localStorage`, navigates to `/app/chat/:id` |
| **Manage** (inside card) | Saves `activeChatbotId`, navigates to `/app/chat/:id/manage` |
| **Cancel** (modal) | Closes modal |
| **Create Chatbot** (modal submit) | Inserts new chatbot, updates list, closes modal |

