### `ChatInterface.tsx` — Main Chat UI (1054 lines)

The most complex component. Manages conversations, messages, workflows, and FAQs.

#### Supabase Queries
| When | Query |
|---|---|
| On load | `supabase.auth.getUser()` |
| Load chatbot | `SELECT id, name, description FROM chatbots WHERE id = :chatbotId` |
| Load conversations | `SELECT * FROM conversations WHERE chatbot_id = :id ORDER BY updated_at DESC` |
| Load messages | `SELECT * FROM messages WHERE conversation_id = :id ORDER BY timestamp ASC` |
| Load FAQs | `SELECT id, question, answer FROM faqs WHERE chatbot_id = :id AND status = 'published' LIMIT 5` |
| Load workflows | `SELECT * FROM workflows WHERE chatbot_id = :id` |
| Stats — total conversations | `SELECT id FROM conversations WHERE chatbot_id = :id` |
| Stats — resolved rate | `SELECT conversation_id FROM messages WHERE role = 'assistant'` (paginated in batches of 1000) |
| Create new conversation | `INSERT INTO conversations (user_id, chatbot_id, title, preview)` |
| Send welcome message | `INSERT INTO messages (conversation_id, role, content)` |
| Send user message | `INSERT INTO messages (conversation_id, role: 'user', content)` |
| Send AI/bot response | `INSERT INTO messages (conversation_id, role: 'assistant', content)` |
| Update conversation title/preview | `UPDATE conversations SET preview, title, updated_at WHERE id = :id` |
| Delete conversation | `DELETE FROM conversations WHERE id = :id` |
| Workflow step message | `INSERT INTO messages (conversation_id, role: 'assistant', content)` |

#### External API Call (Groq via Backend)
```
POST http://localhost:3001/api/chat
Body: { message, chatbotContext, userName, conversationHistory (last 5) }
```
Called after a 1-second delay when the user sends a message (unless a workflow is triggered).
- **429 response** → shows "Daily Message Limit Reached" in chat
- **Error** → shows "I'm experiencing technical difficulties"

#### Workflow Trigger Logic
When user sends a message, it checks:
1. Does the message exactly match a workflow name? → trigger that workflow
2. Is the message a greeting (`hi`, `hello`, `hey`, `start`, `welcome`) AND does a "Welcome" or "Greeting" workflow exist? → trigger it
3. Otherwise → call Groq AI

#### Buttons & Actions (Conversation Sidebar)
| Button | Action |
|---|---|
| **+ (New Chat)** | `handleCreateChat()` — creates conversation + sends greeting |
| **Search input** | Filters conversation list in real time |
| **Conversation item** | `handleSelectConv(id)` — loads messages for that conversation |
| **🗑️ Trash** (on hover) | `handleDeleteChat(id)` — confirm dialog → deletes conversation + messages |

#### Buttons & Actions (Chat Area)
| Button | Action |
|---|---|
| **Manage** (header) | Navigate to `/app/chat/:chatbotId/manage` |
| **FAQ pill** | `handleFAQClick(faq)` — sends the question as user, answers as bot |
| **Workflow trigger** (in welcome bubble) | `startWorkflow(wf)` — starts the named workflow |
| **Workflow option buttons** | `handleWorkflowOptionClick(option)` — advances to next node |
| **😊 Emoji icon** | Opens/closes emoji picker |
| **Emoji selection** | Appends emoji character to `inputValue` |
| **Message textarea** (Enter key) | Calls `handleSend()` |
| **➤ Send arrow** | Calls `handleSend()` |
| **👍 / 👎** (on bot messages) | UI only (no DB write) |
| **📋 Copy** (on bot messages) | `navigator.clipboard.writeText(content)` |

