### `FAQManager.tsx` — FAQ List & Management

#### Supabase Queries
| When | Query |
|---|---|
| On mount | `SELECT * FROM faqs WHERE chatbot_id = :id ORDER BY created_at DESC` |
| Toggle Featured | `UPDATE faqs SET featured = !current WHERE id = :id` |
| Thumbs Up | `UPDATE faqs SET helpful = helpful+1 WHERE id = :id` |
| Thumbs Down | `UPDATE faqs SET not_helpful = not_helpful+1 WHERE id = :id` |
| Delete | `DELETE FROM faqs WHERE id = :id` |
| Duplicate | `supabase.auth.getUser()` + `INSERT INTO faqs (...)` (copy with "(Copy)" suffix, status=draft) |

#### Buttons & Actions
| Button | Action |
|---|---|
| **Import** | Triggers hidden `<input type="file">` → reads JSON → adds to local state (does NOT write to DB) |
| **Export** | Downloads `faqs-export.json` with all FAQs |
| **Add FAQ** | Navigate to `/app/faq/new` |
| **Stat cards** (All / Active / Draft) | Filters FAQ list by status |
| **Search input** | Filters by question, answer, or tags in real time |
| **Clear search ×** | Clears search input |
| **↕ Expand/Collapse chevron** | Shows/hides FAQ answer inline |
| **⭐ Star** | `toggleFeatured()` — toggles featured flag in DB |
| **✏️ Edit** | Navigate to `/app/faq/:id` |
| **📋 Copy** | `duplicateFaq()` — inserts duplicate as draft |
| **🗑️ Delete** | Opens `ConfirmModal` → `deleteFaq()` |
| **👍 Yes / 👎 No** (in expanded answer) | `handleThumbsUp/Down()` — increments helpful counter in DB |
| **Edit Answer** (in expanded) | Navigate to `/app/faq/:id` |

