### `WorkflowEditor.tsx` — Visual Flow Canvas (868 lines)

Has 3 panels: **Builder**, **Preview**, **Simulate**

#### Supabase Queries
| When | Query |
|---|---|
| Load (edit mode) | `SELECT * FROM workflows WHERE id = :id AND chatbot_id = :chatbotId` |
| Save (new) | `INSERT INTO workflows ({ name, description, user_id, chatbot_id, steps: {nodes, edges}, status })` |
| Save (edit) | `UPDATE workflows SET name, description, steps (nodes+edges), updated_at WHERE id = :id` |

> **Note:** nodes and edges are stored serialized as JSON inside the `steps` JSONB column. `migrateWorkflow()` handles deserializing old vs. new formats.

#### Buttons & Actions
| Button | Action |
|---|---|
| **← Back** | Navigate to `/app/workflows` |
| **Name input** | Edits `name` state |
| **Builder / Preview / Simulate tab** | Switches `activePanel` |
| **+ (Big FAB button, canvas)** | `addNode()` — creates a new action node at computed position |
| **🔴 Delete node** | `removeNode(id)` — removes node and all connected edges (trigger node is protected) |
| **Name input (inside node)** | `updateNode(id, { name })` |
| **Bot Message textarea** | `updateNode(id, { message })` |
| **Paths ×** (remove edge) | `removeEdge(edgeId)` |
| **Bottom dot** (connect node) | Sets `connectingSource`, draws live dashed line, connects on mouseUp on another node |
| **Zoom + / Zoom - / Zoom% / Reset** | Zoom controls: `±0.1`, reset to `{x:0, y:0, zoom:1}` |
| **Drag canvas** | Pans view via Framer Motion drag |
| **Pinch (touch)** | Zooms in/out on mobile |
| **Simulate: Start** | `startSimulation()` — shows trigger message |
| **Simulate: Option buttons** | `handleSimulationOptionSelect(edgeId)` — advances through nodes |
| **Simulate: Reset** | Clears simulation state |
| **Save** | `handleSave()` — validates, inserts or updates in DB, navigates back |

