### `AnalyticsPage.tsx` — Platform Metrics

No navigation actions, just data display.

#### Supabase Queries (all on mount + Refresh button)
| Query | Purpose |
|---|---|
| `SELECT id FROM conversations` (paginated ×1000) | Total conversations across all chatbots |
| `SELECT conversation_id FROM messages WHERE role = 'assistant'` (paginated) | Resolved conversations (those with at least one bot reply) |
| `SELECT COUNT(*) FROM workflows` | Total workflow count |
| `SELECT COUNT(*) FROM faqs WHERE status = 'published'` | Published FAQ count |

**Metrics Displayed:** Total Chats, Resolved Rate %, Active Workflows, Published FAQs

#### Button
| Button | Action |
|---|---|
| **Refresh** | Re-runs `fetchAnalytics()` |

